{"speciesId":776,"names":{"fr":"Boumata","es":"Turtonator","en":"Turtonator","ja":"バクガメス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Sa carapace est très instable. Si on la heurte par mégarde, elle explose. Le creux sur son ventre est son point faible."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Posee un caparazón que estalla al contacto. El orificio que se aprecia en su vientre es su punto débil."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"The shell on its back is chemically unstable and explodes violently if struck. The hole in its stomach is its weak point."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"背中の 甲羅は 爆発物。 うっかり 殴れば 大爆発。 お腹の 穴が 弱点。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il peut cracher des flammes et du gaz toxique par les naseaux. Ses excréments sont des explosifs qui peuvent servir à plein de choses."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Despide llamas y gas venenoso por sus fosas nasales. Sus excrementos tienen un sinfín de aplicaciones por sus propiedades explosivas."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It gushes fire and poisonous gases from its nostrils. Its dung is an explosive substance and can be put to various uses."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"鼻の 孔から 炎や 毒ガスを 吹く。 フンは 爆発物で 色んな 使い道が ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il vit dans les volcans et se nourrit de soufre et de minéraux. Les composants de ses repas renforcent sa carapace explosive."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Vive en los volcanes y se alimenta de azufre y minerales. Los componentes que ingiere le sirven para formar su caparazón explosivo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It lives in volcanoes and eats sulfur and other minerals. Materials from the food it eats form the basis of its explosive shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"火山に 棲み 硫黄や 鉱物を 食っている。 食ったエサの 成分が 爆発する 甲羅の 元に なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sa carapace explosive est très dangereuse, mais elle est sensible à l’humidité. Il se cache donc au fond de sa grotte les jours de pluie."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su caparazón explosivo es un verdadero peligro, pero no aguanta bien la humedad. Los días de lluvia, este Pokémon se refugia en una cueva."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its exploding shell poses a real danger but is sensitive to moisture. On rainy days, Turtonator takes silent refuge in caves."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"爆発する 甲羅は 厄介だが 湿気に 弱い。 雨の 日は 洞窟の奥で じっと している。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il s’abrite derrière une carapace couverte d’explosifs. Lorsqu’un ennemi l’attaque, il riposte à grands coups de déflagrations."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su caparazón está recubierto de un material explosivo. Responde con un gran estallido a todo aquel que lo ataque."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Explosive substances coat the shell on its back. Enemies that dare attack it will be blown away by an immense detonation."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"爆薬で コーティングされた 甲羅を 背負う。 攻撃してきた 敵を 大爆発で 返り討ち。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il vit dans les volcans. Le soufre dont il se nourrit rend sa carapace explosive. Même ses selles sont dangereuses, car elles sont instables."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"El material explosivo de su caparazón está compuesto por el azufre del que se alimenta. Sus excrementos explosivos son muy peligrosos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Eating sulfur in its volcanic habitat is what causes explosive compounds to develop in its shell. Its droppings are also dangerously explosive."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"火山で 暮らし 食べた 硫黄が 甲羅の 爆薬の もとになる。 フンも 爆発する 危険物。"}],"varieties":[{"id":776,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]